|--------------------------------------------------------------------------
| ASHMAAN
| Phase 8.7D — Solar Energy / Yield Analytics
|--------------------------------------------------------------------------
|
| Pure engineering analytics service.
|
| PURPOSE
|
| Qualify Solar Charger yield / energy evidence without fabricating
| engineering-energy semantics.
|
| Canonical Phase 8.7D evidence:
|
|   attr94  — current-day yield
|   attr96  — previous-day yield
|   attr285 — counter-like user yield
|   attr340 — yield-delta evidence
|
| IMPORTANT
|
| This service DOES NOT:
|
| - query MongoDB
| - persist telemetry
| - infer kWh from magnitude
| - infer units from attribute names
| - integrate attr442 while its power unit is unresolved
| - sum attr94 / attr96 / attr285 / attr340
| - sum multiple Solar Chargers automatically
| - treat repeated daily-yield samples as interval energy
| - automatically label a counter decrease as a reset
| - treat PV-to-battery / PV-to-consumers as total PV energy
| - calculate availability
| - calculate performance ratio
| - calculate capacity factor
| - infer installed PV capacity
|--------------------------------------------------------------------------
*/


